 applies the leadership, organizational-culture, ethics, or change-management principle tested by the scenario. <b>D. All of the above</b> <span class=\"tb-source-ref\">Source: Pocket Study Guide CMQ-OE, Question 135.</span>"},"revision":"fcd589fa65d7422623a5b54badf1ede085cc53d089d61c0fde4e1c9024b4df4b"},"cmq:set-1:source-136":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":0,\"options\":[\"Cause leader\",\"Organization leader\",\"Opinion leader\",\"Public leader\"],\"sourceQuestion\":136,\"stem\":\"It may work behind the scenes or be highly visible to followers. Through personal motivation and power of persuasion, this leader gathers followers to a common goal, sometimes inciting the followers to take physical action against a targeted group. It is a:\",\"sub\":\"cmq-lead\",\"why\":\"This response best applies the leadership, organizational-culture, ethics, or change-management principle tested by the scenario. <b>A. Cause leader</b> <span class=\\\"tb-source-ref\\\">Source: Pocket Study Guide CMQ-OE, Question 136.</span>\"}","content":{"answer":0,"options":["Cause leader","Organization leader","Opinion leader","Public leader"],"sourceQuestion":136,"stem":"It may work behind the scenes or be highly visible to followers. Through personal motivation and power of persuasion, this leader gathers followers to a common goal, sometimes inciting the followers to take physical action against a targeted group. It is a:","sub":"cmq-lead","why":"This response best applies the leadership, organizational-culture, ethics, or change-management principle tested by the scenario. <b>A. Cause leader</b> <span class=\"tb-source-ref\">Source: Pocket Study Guide CMQ-OE, Question 136.</span>"},"revision":"bff97db6c8685a8af28fd71f1da35849c636cf6802a648b1d6ba910cfe580425"},"cmq:set-1:source-137":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":1,\"options\":[\"Cause leader\",\"Organization leader\",\"Opinion leader\",\"Public leader\"],\"sourceQuestion\":137,\"stem\":\"An individual is perceived as a leader by subordinat