dividual concerning issues involving Lean Six Sigma. [III.C.1]\"}","content":{"answer":1,"options":["A mentor helps individuals choose the proper tools to use in Six Sigma projects.","A mentor focuses on the individual from a career perspective.","A mentor is a Master Black Belt.","A mentor concentrates on project-specific issues."],"stem":"What sets the mentor role apart from the coaching role?","sub":"tm","why":"A mentor focuses on an individual from a career perspective; a coach focuses on the individual concerning issues involving Lean Six Sigma. [III.C.1]"},"revision":"99bccd7863d0667ecd7954ea03174ecf51b71fc12bacacb2946301c4a7ba5a1b"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-229":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"Lasso\",\"Redirect\",\"Idea floating\",\"Direct probe\"],\"stem\":\"A team is having trouble generating ideas for improvement. The team facilitator can spark the team''s creativity by using which technique?\",\"sub\":\"tm\",\"why\":\"A facilitator can use the idea-floating method to spark the team''s creativity. [III.C.1]\"}","content":{"answer":2,"options":["Lasso","Redirect","Idea floating","Direct probe"],"stem":"A team is having trouble generating ideas for improvement. The team facilitator can spark the team''s creativity by using which technique?","sub":"tm","why":"A facilitator can use the idea-floating method to spark the team''s creativity. [III.C.1]"},"revision":"bed2cdd05effbd5afba68685ac4a68b9a347f76817a4aac7d105532efba1eb39"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-23":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"Replace internal process data with industry averages.\",\"Perform root cause analysis.\",\"Drive breakthrough improvement.\",\"Determine critical-to-quality features.\"],\"stem\":\"What is the primary improvement objective of benchmarking?\",\"sub\":\"p2\",\"why\":\"Benchmarking gathers comparison data to reveal attainable best-in-class performance. Its primary improvement objective is to drive breakthrough improvement rather than merely collect indu