m different locations and areas of the organization to collaborate without travel. They may use both synchronous and asynchronous communication. [III.A.1]\"}","content":{"answer":3,"options":["Reduced technology costs.","A requirement that all communication be asynchronous.","An emphasis on small teams.","Increased flexibility in member location and scheduling."],"stem":"Which is a primary organizational advantage of a virtual team over a co-located team?","sub":"tm","why":"Virtual teams increase flexibility by allowing members from different locations and areas of the organization to collaborate without travel. They may use both synchronous and asynchronous communication. [III.A.1]"},"revision":"91e3790e15a012ce6dddc4e28b2a8d2770a75d95f38f7942f155a5ee79af5bce"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-270":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":3,\"options\":[\"affinity diagram.\",\"Gantt chart.\",\"scatter plot.\",\"matrix diagram.\"],\"stem\":\"Quality function deployment is an example of a more complicated:\",\"sub\":\"def\",\"why\":\"Quality function deployment uses the house of quality, which is an example of a matrix diagram. [IV.D.3]\"}","content":{"answer":3,"options":["affinity diagram.","Gantt chart.","scatter plot.","matrix diagram."],"stem":"Quality function deployment is an example of a more complicated:","sub":"def","why":"Quality function deployment uses the house of quality, which is an example of a matrix diagram. [IV.D.3]"},"revision":"efd81b70066084a15879d02d61adb0a38d3c1f049999e677239068bbabf693a2"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-271":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":0,\"options\":[\"matrix diagram.\",\"affinity diagram.\",\"Pareto chart.\",\"histogram.\"],\"stem\":\"A tool that compares two or more sets of data to discover existing relationships is the:\",\"sub\":\"def\",\"why\":\"The matrix diagram compares two or more sets of data to discover existing relationships. [IV.D.3]\"}","content":{"answer":0,"options":["matrix diagram.","affinity diagram.","Pareto chart.","histogram."],"