3\",\"4\"],\"stem\":\"A gage R&R study is conducted with three inspection technicians. In the analysis, how many degrees of freedom (df) are associated with the technicians?\",\"sub\":\"mea\",\"why\":\"The degrees of freedom are equal to 1 less than the number of technicians, calculated as (3 − 1) = 2. [V.C.1]\"}","content":{"answer":1,"options":["1","2","3","4"],"stem":"A gage R&R study is conducted with three inspection technicians. In the analysis, how many degrees of freedom (df) are associated with the technicians?","sub":"mea","why":"The degrees of freedom are equal to 1 less than the number of technicians, calculated as (3 − 1) = 2. [V.C.1]"},"revision":"5a3fca63b8a6751a720bc3ecf90c303a911e8d0737c3cc8a5f5126f51930201c"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-314":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"are only used in manufacturing applications.\",\"cannot be applied to human resources.\",\"can be used to assess supplier performance.\",\"are separate from the marketing function.\"],\"stem\":\"Measurement systems:\",\"sub\":\"mea\",\"why\":\"Measurement systems can be used to assess supplier performance. [V.C.2]\"}","content":{"answer":2,"options":["are only used in manufacturing applications.","cannot be applied to human resources.","can be used to assess supplier performance.","are separate from the marketing function."],"stem":"Measurement systems:","sub":"mea","why":"Measurement systems can be used to assess supplier performance. [V.C.2]"},"revision":"9e278b942ff88e9fb858403bbabcec588bed3cf41b2817039dc781fb3b4c2459"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-315":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":1,\"options\":[\"customer loyalty surveys.\",\"performance evaluations.\",\"equipment calibration.\",\"gage traceability.\"],\"stem\":\"An example of a measurement system used in human resources is:\",\"sub\":\"mea\",\"why\":\"Performance evaluations are an example of a measurement system used in human resources. [V.C.2]\"}","content":{"answer":1,"options":["customer loyalty surveys.","performa