mbly process as soon as they are completed. [VII.B.1]\"}","content":{"answer":0,"options":["as soon as they are completed.","when the customer requests it.","when the next machine is ready.","at the end of the day."],"stem":"In a push system, parts move along an assembly process:","sub":"imp","why":"In a push system, parts move along an assembly process as soon as they are completed. [VII.B.1]"},"revision":"320bfc5b5acf5c455f07652698ad7f70cde0388078139d07b07935acbae274c6"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-465":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"5S.\",\"poka-yoke.\",\"Kanban.\",\"Heijunka.\"],\"stem\":\"A system that simplifies and improves the restocking procedure is called:\",\"sub\":\"imp\",\"why\":\"Kanban is a system that simplifies and improves the restocking procedure. [VII.B.1]\"}","content":{"answer":2,"options":["5S.","poka-yoke.","Kanban.","Heijunka."],"stem":"A system that simplifies and improves the restocking procedure is called:","sub":"imp","why":"Kanban is a system that simplifies and improves the restocking procedure. [VII.B.1]"},"revision":"afc825c14b02c48ec13ecf345a4e3390ddcaea6850074f9117c140028825f437"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-466":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":1,\"options\":[\"Items that do not belong are removed from the workspace.\",\"Necessary items are arranged and organized.\",\"The area is cleaned and shined.\",\"The process is mistake proofed.\"],\"stem\":\"What occurs in the second step of the 5S technique?\",\"sub\":\"imp\",\"why\":\"In the second step of 5S, necessary items are arranged and organized. This is known as Set in Order. [VII.B.1]\"}","content":{"answer":1,"options":["Items that do not belong are removed from the workspace.","Necessary items are arranged and organized.","The area is cleaned and shined.","The process is mistake proofed."],"stem":"What occurs in the second step of the 5S technique?","sub":"imp","why":"In the second step of 5S, necessary items are arranged and organized. This is known as Set in Order. [VII.B.