o influence on the occurrence of a second event, the events are considered to be:\",\"sub\":\"mea\",\"why\":\"Independent events have no influence over each other. [V.E.1]\"}","content":{"answer":3,"options":["mutually exclusive.","dependent.","multiplicative.","independent."],"stem":"When the occurrence of an event has no influence on the occurrence of a second event, the events are considered to be:","sub":"mea","why":"Independent events have no influence over each other. [V.E.1]"},"revision":"9197a3f2220c780db430134c623642b5b345b80ccf5151edf3c2fd76ccbf54ce"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-587":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"the loss of key personnel.\",\"pandemics.\",\"the loss of intellectual property.\",\"strikes by bargaining unit personnel.\"],\"stem\":\"Issues that an asset security continuity plan may address include:\",\"sub\":\"p1\",\"why\":\"An asset security continuity plan may include the loss of intellectual property. [I.A.4]\"}","content":{"answer":2,"options":["the loss of key personnel.","pandemics.","the loss of intellectual property.","strikes by bargaining unit personnel."],"stem":"Issues that an asset security continuity plan may address include:","sub":"p1","why":"An asset security continuity plan may include the loss of intellectual property. [I.A.4]"},"revision":"4536f8c44894033b4e83056e9d0ff0e814c31d359362dc8db26ac1d0882e08e4"},"cssbb:set-3:legacy-588":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"Gantt chart.\",\"interrelationship diagram.\",\"work breakdown structure.\",\"tollgate review.\"],\"stem\":\"When implementing a large project, the tool that should be used to show how the smaller activities are linked to larger activities is called a:\",\"sub\":\"def\",\"why\":\"A work breakdown structure is used to show how smaller activities are linked to larger activities in a project. This information can then be used as an input to a Gantt chart. [IV.C.3]\"}","content":{"answer":2,"options":["Gantt chart.","interrelationship diag