ix Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A III. Measure Phase, Question 98 (print p. 68), III.F.3.</span>"},"revision":"6805b456dc51a9e2e39a88ea56262434525e82651ac78fa559b4106d463de4b0"},"cssgb:set-2:source-325:5m2iwb":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"bokReference\":\"III.F.3\",\"chart\":{\"columns\":[\"Parameter\",\"Value\"],\"rows\":[[\"Total sample size\",\"125\"],[\"Subgroup size\",\"5\"],[\"Number of subgroups\",\"25\"],[\"X̿\",\"0.52\"],[\"R̄\",\"0.66\"],[\"Overall sample standard deviation\",\"0.29\"],[\"LSL\",\"0\"],[\"USL\",\"2\"],[\"X̄-chart limits\",\"[0.13, 0.90]\"],[\"R-chart limits\",\"[0, 1.40]\"]],\"type\":\"data-table\"},\"options\":[\"0.60\",\"0.61\",\"1.15\",\"1.17\"],\"sourceEpubFile\":\"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter3.xhtml\",\"sourceGlobalQuestion\":325,\"sourcePart\":\"Part A: Sample Questions by BoK\",\"sourcePrintPage\":68,\"sourceQuestion\":99,\"sourceSection\":\"III. Measure Phase\",\"sourceType\":\"Book BoK Sample Question\",\"stem\":\"Calculate the estimated value of Pp.\",\"sub\":\"cssgb-measure\",\"why\":\"To estimate Pp, we use: Pp = (2−0)/(6×0.29) = 1.15. <b>C. 1.15</b> <span class=\\\"tb-source-ref\\\">Source: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A III. Measure Phase, Question 99 (print p. 68), III.F.3.</span>\"}","content":{"answer":2,"bokReference":"III.F.3","chart":{"columns":["Parameter","Value"],"rows":[["Total sample size","125"],["Subgroup size","5"],["Number of subgroups","25"],["X̿","0.52"],["R̄","0.66"],["Overall sample standard deviation","0.29"],["LSL","0"],["USL","2"],["X̄-chart limits","[0.13, 0.90]"],["R-chart limits","[0, 1.40]"]],"type":"data-table"},"options":["0.60","0.61","1.15","1.17"],"sourceEpubFile":"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter3.xhtml","sourceGlobalQuestion":325,"sourcePart":"Part A: Sample Questions by BoK","sourcePrintPage":68,"sourceQuestion":99,"sourceSection":"III. Measure Phase","sourceType":"Book BoK Sample Question","stem":"Calculate the estimated value of Pp.","sub":"cssgb-measure","w