vice is classified as waste. <b>A. waste.</b> <span class=\\\"tb-source-ref\\\">Source: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A V. Improve Phase, Question 35 (print p. 118), V.C.1.</span>\"}","content":{"answer":0,"bokReference":"V.C.1","options":["waste.","kanban.","takt time.","kaizen."],"sourceEpubFile":"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter5.xhtml","sourceGlobalQuestion":435,"sourcePart":"Part A: Sample Questions by BoK","sourcePrintPage":118,"sourceQuestion":35,"sourceSection":"V. Improve Phase","sourceType":"Book BoK Sample Question","stem":"Any activity that does not add value to a product or service is classified as:","sub":"cssgb-improve","why":"Any activity that does not add value to a product or service is classified as waste. <b>A. waste.</b> <span class=\"tb-source-ref\">Source: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A V. Improve Phase, Question 35 (print p. 118), V.C.1.</span>"},"revision":"3f5fccf3ab94aa37ebddaf87d7f8dd9a73ba9bc00f6491faddfb112d8a7c7cd2"},"cssgb:set-2:source-436:1up69ca":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"bokReference\":\"V.C.1\",\"options\":[\"appraisal cost.\",\"the value stream.\",\"waste.\",\"pull systems.\"],\"sourceEpubFile\":\"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter5.xhtml\",\"sourceGlobalQuestion\":436,\"sourcePart\":\"Part A: Sample Questions by BoK\",\"sourcePrintPage\":118,\"sourceQuestion\":36,\"sourceSection\":\"V. Improve Phase\",\"sourceType\":\"Book BoK Sample Question\",\"stem\":\"Defects, excess motion, and rework are all forms of:\",\"sub\":\"cssgb-improve\",\"why\":\"Defects, excess motion, and rework are all forms of waste. <b>C. waste.</b> <span class=\\\"tb-source-ref\\\">Source: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A V. Improve Phase, Question 36 (print p. 118), V.C.1.</span>\"}","content":{"answer":2,"bokReference":"V.C.1","options":["appraisal cost.","the value stream.","waste.","pull systems."],"sourceEpubFile":"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter5.xhtml","sourceGlobalQuestion":436,