urce: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A VI. Control Phase, Question 28 (print p. 132), VI.A.3.</span>"},"revision":"f40d0cae36dcd2650f1f9c87ba639b011e819635441936423955dd41da54d313"},"cssgb:set-2:source-473:uwm1ss":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":3,\"bokReference\":\"VI.B.1\",\"options\":[\"the nonconforming products or out-of-control conditions.\",\"the design of experiments.\",\"the safety characteristics in the design.\",\"the workflow in your process.\"],\"sourceEpubFile\":\"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter6.xhtml\",\"sourceGlobalQuestion\":473,\"sourcePart\":\"Part A: Sample Questions by BoK\",\"sourcePrintPage\":132,\"sourceQuestion\":29,\"sourceSection\":\"VI. Control Phase\",\"sourceType\":\"Book BoK Sample Question\",\"stem\":\"The control plan explains how to control:\",\"sub\":\"cssgb-control\",\"why\":\"The control plan is a document explaining how to control your process’s workflow. <b>D. the workflow in your process.</b> <span class=\\\"tb-source-ref\\\">Source: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A VI. Control Phase, Question 29 (print p. 132), VI.B.1.</span>\"}","content":{"answer":3,"bokReference":"VI.B.1","options":["the nonconforming products or out-of-control conditions.","the design of experiments.","the safety characteristics in the design.","the workflow in your process."],"sourceEpubFile":"OEBPS/xhtml/chapter6.xhtml","sourceGlobalQuestion":473,"sourcePart":"Part A: Sample Questions by BoK","sourcePrintPage":132,"sourceQuestion":29,"sourceSection":"VI. Control Phase","sourceType":"Book BoK Sample Question","stem":"The control plan explains how to control:","sub":"cssgb-control","why":"The control plan is a document explaining how to control your process’s workflow. <b>D. the workflow in your process.</b> <span class=\"tb-source-ref\">Source: The ASQ Certified Six Sigma Green Belt Study Guide (2024), Part A VI. Control Phase, Question 29 (print p. 132), VI.B.1.</span>"},"revision":"992bd91cf5ddf75