us project reviews","It guarantees that no legal dispute can occur","It establishes decision rights, accountability, review discipline, and escalation paths","It substitutes compliance reporting for project leadership"],"sourceAnswer":"C","sourceAssessment":"Simulated Examination Questions for Parts I–VI","sourceDocument":"The Certified Six Sigma Master Black Belt Handbook","sourceQuestion":49,"stem":"What is the primary value of governance at the individual-project level?","sub":"mbb-portfolio","why":"Project governance supplies structure and rigor through explicit authority, accountability, reviews, and escalation—not immunity from risk or a reduction in oversight. <b>C. It establishes decision rights, accountability, review discipline, and escalation paths</b> <span class=\"tb-source-ref\">Source: The Certified Six Sigma Master Black Belt Handbook, simulated examination, Question 49; normalized for four-choice delivery.</span>"},"revision":"451a9fd4daa33958bb0ff8ced46aae1dfc988339121872469649caa729d3f734"},"mbb:set-1:source-5":{"canonicalContent":"{\"answer\":2,\"options\":[\"Executive steering committee, human resource council, strategic planning council\",\"Strategic planning council, board of directors, human resource council\",\"Executive steering committee, quality council, Lean Six Sigma deployment team\",\"Quality council, Lean Six Sigma deployment team, strategic planning council\"],\"sourceAnswer\":\"C\",\"sourceAssessment\":\"Simulated Examination Questions for Parts I–VI\",\"sourceDocument\":\"The Certified Six Sigma Master Black Belt Handbook\",\"sourceQuestion\":5,\"stem\":\"A common Lean Six Sigma governance structure contains which of the following components?\",\"sub\":\"mbb-enterprise\",\"why\":\"An executive steering committee supplies sponsorship, a quality council provides cross-enterprise governance, and the deployment team coordinates execution. <b>C. Executive steering committee, quality council, Lean Six Sigma deployment team</b> <span cla